OL,3,GNEWSASchool evacuated over 'malicious
OL,4,Acommunication'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school has been evacuated and pupils
OL,7,Fsent home early after police received a
OL,8,Freport of a "malicious communication".
OL,10,FCoquet Community School in Amble,
OL,11,FNorthumberland, cleared students from
OL,12,Fits main building to the old sports
OL,13,Fhall of the former James Calvert Spence
OL,14,FCollege earlier and reassured parents
OL,15,Fall pupils were "safe and well".
OL,17,FNorthumbria Police confirmed it had
OL,18,Fbeen called out at about 09:00 GMT. An
OL,19,Fambulance crew and two hazardous area
OL,20,Fresponse crews were also sent to the
OL,21,Fschool.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
