OL,3,GNEWSASchool evacuated over 'malicious
OL,4,Acommunication'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a message to parents on social
OL,7,Fmedia, headteacher James Andriot said:
OL,8,F"I hope you can support us with your
OL,9,Funderstanding, we have prioritised the
OL,10,Fsafety of everyone in this matter."
